menu "PalmPilot"
    config PALMPILOT_BENCH
        bool "Bench profile for the first physical flights"
        default n
        help
            Builds the settings used on the physical bench on 2026-11-17 (see
            docs/bench-bringup.md): ENABLE toggles instead of being held, ENABLE
            and arming accept up to 20% throttle, no thumb gestures, the hub
            ignores CALIBRATE, right-hand pitch is inverted and yaw is softened.
            The simulation suites test the default (n).
endmenu
